sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kafka
    participant C as Camel adjudication route
    participant D as JDBC lookup routes
    participant AI as HTTP AI server
    K->>C: Claim reference
    C->>D: InOut claim and member coverage lookups
    D-->>C: Authoritative evidence snapshot
    C->>AI: Evidence and generated policy rules, no tools
    AI-->>C: Decision JSON
    Note over C: Strict parsing and local schema validation
    C->>D: Re-read evidence after inference
    D-->>C: Current facts
    Note over C: Reject stale evidence and inconsistent decisions
    C->>K: Validated result or failure
    C->>K: Commit offset after publication
    Note over C,K: Commit failures propagate without a claim-failure event
